</div>
</section>
<section id="S6.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Reproducibility Statement</h3>

<div id="S6.SSx1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S6.SSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Section <a href="#S3" title="3 Experiment Setup ‣ Know Thyself? On the Incapability and Implications of AI Self-Recognition" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, we clearly state how we construct the testing data and how we call the model. Our code is available at: <a href="https://github.com/ChicagoHAI/self-recognition" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/ChicagoHAI/self-recognition</a>. In the Appendix <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C Task Design ‣ Know Thyself? On the Incapability and Implications of AI Self-Recognition" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a> and Appendix <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Evaluation Prompts ‣ Know Thyself? On the Incapability and Implications of AI Self-Recognition" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a>, we include the prompt we use to generate the data and evaluate the reasoning.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
